  "title": "Curry Pasta Salad",
  "description": "Raisins, carrots, pine nuts, and tofu are tossed with colorful pasta spirals and blanketed with an aromatic blend of curry powder, lemon juice, and mayonnaise or yogurt for a scintillating summer curry pasta salad.",
